# lmost post: patterns of private matters (extended regular expressions, case-insensitive, one per line). On a
# connection with PRIVATE_GUARD=on a post where one matches is not sent (exit code 5). Everyone keeps their own: names of
# personal machines and servers, personal projects and paths — what a work chat does not need to hear about.
# File: ~/.config/lmost/private-patterns (`lmost setup` creates it from this example, never over yours).
# \bmy-home-server\b
